  unitName: Eight Blade Sefia
  unitId: 50162
  unitNumber: 299
  description: The woman warrior who wore 8 blades on her back. At the time there
    was no one who knew where she came from, where she was headed, or what she was
    after. There weren't even many who had the chance to speak with her. However,
    her actions were witnessed in many lands far and wide as she went from place
    to place, vanquishing otherworldly beings that were causing havoc. It is said
    that as mystical as she seemed, she still struck fear in the hearts of any who
    saw her.
  summonDesc: What is it you want?<br>I see...<br>OK, I will lend you my power.
  fusionDesc: My power increases with<br>every ray of light that dwells<br>within
    my 8 blades.
